A||||4||BC-GT||Torque convertor lock-up control on carbed automatic?||||1||
Z||000000||BC-GT||08-11-2001||10:28 PM||||After reading Formulas post about his carbed Fiero <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/009429.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/009429.html</A>   I was wondering if anyone knew how you would control the convertor lock-up function on an auto if I were to go that route.<P>------------------<BR>Darryl Martin<BR>1985 GT <BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.imagestation.com/picture/pf251a969c96964ef15691e97e7ac4489/feb64e3a.jpg.orig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||isthiswhereiputausername?||08-11-2001||11:19 PM||||I have a little switch on my console between my power windows(also have a switch there for my fan)<P>||||reg||1
Z||000002||Cozmo||08-12-2001||06:49 AM||||Some older British cars had a switch on the top of the gearshift knob to activate an electronic overdrive (only worked in the two top gears). The setup was very similar to the TC in the TH-125 and with some "creative fabrication" you could probably do the same thing.  It actually is a pretty practical setup, I used to enjoy driving my Triumphs with the "extra gears" <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>BobC ||||reg||1
Z||000003||Formula||08-12-2001||10:57 AM||||I guess I need to do that too.. ||||reg||1
Z||000004||theogre||08-12-2001||03:02 PM||||read in my cave. there's some data there. Doing this safely isn't quite as simple as stuffing in a switch. you have to make sure it will automatically unlock. That means it matters where the switch goes and how it's wired.<P>At the very least you need to make sure you use the third gear and brake switches. You're new switch needs to be wired to replace the ECM contacts. This way the TCC will let go when you drop out of high gear or when you tap the brake. This will keep you from killing the engine when you stop.<P>the schematic for that circuit is in all the service books. even haynes has it.<p>[This message has been edited by theogre (edited 08-12-2001).]||||reg||1
